        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/6f9a4e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-03T10:17:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I didn't see this in the rulebook so I thought I would ask.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you get attacked and your attack or defense renders one of the Tech upgrades (the ones on the side of your ship) useless, does that card go to your discard pile or are those cards permanently fixated on there till the end of the game? In my mind I think if their value is gone, then they are discarded, but I don't know. Any ideas?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:41:29.489Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
