        "id": 105497,
        "name": "Pydro",
        "username": "Pydro",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-03T10:42:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>They are scrapped: perform any scrap effects, and, put them in the appropriate pile. If it was Tech from a Station card, ig oes on top of the Station scrap, Opp side up. If it was a Tech from a starting card of an SF deck, it is essentially removed from the game, and goes to a scrap with all the other SF cards.</p>",
